{"3535600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde", "steam_appid": 3535600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/c060cdd0960a557745bb452c4e4fcd9c.avif?t=1770960107\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>A Father's Wrath. A Sister's Prophecy. A Child Lost to the Shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the blood-soaked boots of Asbjorn, a fallen warrior consumed by vengeance, in <i>Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde</i> — a brutal side-scrolling action game that blends cinematic storytelling, intense melee combat, and a haunting Nordic world torn by myth, sorrow, and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a sequel. It’s a reckoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Side-Scrolling Combat with a Twist:</strong><br>Explore a rich 2.5D world with dynamic 90° camera turns that unveil new paths, perspectives, and ambushes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.mp4?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Two Paths, One Bloodline:</strong><br>Play as Asbjorn, the wrathful berserker, and Volva, his sister-in-law and a gifted seer. Both are bound by loss, yet guided by different visions of fate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.mp4?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Gritty Norse Atmosphere:</strong><br>From scorched villages to crumbling temples, the world is steeped in decay and forgotten faith. Every step forward uncovers more of the past — and the cost of revenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> No Mercy Combat:</strong><br>Master brutal melee mechanics, unlock berserker abilities, and battle foes that demand precision and aggression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/39f56b4e44d2e8c228f7ef7c83d44d49.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=800 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/39f56b4e44d2e8c228f7ef7c83d44d49.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A Personal Journey:</strong><br>Driven by the loss of his wife and the abduction of his child, Asbjorn’s path is one of violence, but also revelation. Some truths are buried deeper than the blade can reach.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/79973aca71ab8e492870e1edd987129e.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/79973aca71ab8e492870e1edd987129e.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/79973aca71ab8e492870e1edd987129e.mp4?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/c060cdd0960a557745bb452c4e4fcd9c.avif?t=1770960107\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong>A Father's Wrath. A Sister's Prophecy. A Child Lost to the Shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the blood-soaked boots of Asbjorn, a fallen warrior consumed by vengeance, in <i>Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde</i> — a brutal side-scrolling action game that blends cinematic storytelling, intense melee combat, and a haunting Nordic world torn by myth, sorrow, and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a sequel. It’s a reckoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Side-Scrolling Combat with a Twist:</strong><br>Explore a rich 2.5D world with dynamic 90° camera turns that unveil new paths, perspectives, and ambushes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.mp4?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Two Paths, One Bloodline:</strong><br>Play as Asbjorn, the wrathful berserker, and Volva, his sister-in-law and a gifted seer. Both are bound by loss, yet guided by different visions of fate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.mp4?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Gritty Norse Atmosphere:</strong><br>From scorched villages to crumbling temples, the world is steeped in decay and forgotten faith. Every step forward uncovers more of the past — and the cost of revenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> No Mercy Combat:</strong><br>Master brutal melee mechanics, unlock berserker abilities, and battle foes that demand precision and aggression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/39f56b4e44d2e8c228f7ef7c83d44d49.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=800 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/39f56b4e44d2e8c228f7ef7c83d44d49.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> A Personal Journey:</strong><br>Driven by the loss of his wife and the abduction of his child, Asbjorn’s path is one of violence, but also revelation. Some truths are buried deeper than the blade can reach.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/79973aca71ab8e492870e1edd987129e.poster.avif?t=1770960107\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/79973aca71ab8e492870e1edd987129e.webm?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/79973aca71ab8e492870e1edd987129e.mp4?t=1770960107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Norse action-adventure side-view game where rage-fueled combat, mythic storytelling, and shifting perspectives collide. Fight as Asbjorn and Volva in a dark saga of loss, runes, and vengeance.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/723023861e340decee330bd66198a518c4cfdab9/header.jpg?t=1770960107", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/de7ab6d92cfcfd4dd29da3ee4a578ee22a1b1fe4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770960107", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/de7ab6d92cfcfd4dd29da3ee4a578ee22a1b1fe4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770960107", "website": "https://onelifegames.net/berserker-2-the-saga-of-hilde/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 G